SL 2, ASL 3, and ASL 4)  for $79.95?  \nSee \"SuperUSB\" in the ASLUniversity bookstore at: https://lifeprint.com/bookstore/books...\n\nFor free ASL Lessons see:    / billvicars  \nTo learn basic fingerspelling see    • ABC's in ASL: Learn how to Fingerspell!  \n\nAbout your instructor:\nhttp://www.lifeprint.com/asl101/pages...\nWarm regards and love to you all.\nI am grateful for your support.\nDr. Bill\n:)","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":158,"length":25,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPUBEM2rARgBIhMIu8H2sra4kwMVf22dCR0smQFySJKCvOS98oL1c8oBBHhyVWg=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqbllJc2ZXcERxQm54aFBubWt5dlpiS0hQNGg5Z3xBQ3Jtc0trbmdzMTJNRFNDbEh0UHVlajlDUGVaN2VCVGpYbHZNWGpoYWEyellaRlI0SzFWb2FDaEhSbWY1Z0ZQbVRHXzJZTW1XbkF2WXRYLWd0MHZ6cjdobVZEVXZsclU5YkIxcmdpTlVzTkVOTXk2X0hlQ0xCcw\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.Lifeprint.com%2F\u0026v=c-oLk9yPARI","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqbllJc2ZXcERxQm54aFBubWt5dlpiS0hQNGg5Z3xBQ3Jtc0trbmdzMTJNRFNDbEh0UHVlajlDUGVaN2VCVGpYbHZNWGpoYWEyellaRlI0SzFWb2FDaEhSbWY1Z0ZQbVRHXzJZTW1XbkF2WXRYLWd0MHZ6cjdobVZEVXZsclU5YkIxcmdpTlVzTkVOTXk2X0hlQ0xCcw\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.Lifeprint.com%2F\u0026v=c-oLk9yPARI","target":"TARGET_NEW_WINDOW","nofollow":true}}}},{"startIndex":270,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CPUBEM2rARgBIhMIu8H2sra4kwMVf22dCR0smQFySJKCvOS98oL1c8oBBHhyVWg=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUFFLUhqbTQ3M1ViMzlOaEpqZS1QU2V4cjZNcUt4X2JXUXxBQ3Jtc0tucEhEVFloWk1RdzQydU91S1pIZkNLcWpIQ281NWNWV3dYQUtMVWdQMDRmZTJLUU44R0xWZG12OFEweW1PamNaYWc5UXFaUUdrbmV1T2R5SXdJUjB2dTM0czE2cWdsLXNLQXBvVVp3NU1qdDA5b0VIYw\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.paypal.com%2Fcgi-bin%2Fwebscr%3Fcmd%3D_s-xclick%26hosted_butto